## 8. Reproducing by hand

$ PYTHONPATH=/home/user python -m cat_theo_machine.visualiser.server --port 8801
$ PYTHONPATH=/home/user python -m cat_theo_machine.visualiser.examples.machine_workload --delay 0.6

The first serves http://127.0.0.1:8801/; the second is an ordinary Machine
script started in another terminal. Record, stop the script, then Replay reads
the session file with no Machine process alive.
